# expect: ACK: done
42.0|=Ultralite 81032697B1000000000000000000000000000001
# expect: ACK: done
# also:   done
44.0|?Period
# expect: ACK: 10

# ---- B9: Period = 0xFFFFFFFF: el setter ignores it
